						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="creditButtonStandalone"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>标题:</strong> dingir<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-445777-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup><br /> <strong>作图:</strong> ©︎<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hitsujikaip" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6611312&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607865611" alt="hitsujikaip" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6611312)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hitsujikaip" >hitsujikaip</a></span><br /> <strong>年份:</strong> 2020</p> <p><strong>底本:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-076">SCP-076</a><br /> <strong>原作:</strong> ©︎<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kain-pathos-crow" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=172549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607865611" alt="Kain Pathos Crow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=172549)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kain-pathos-crow" >Kain Pathos Crow</a></span></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>亚伯</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <p>cul me<sub>3</sub><sup>!</sup>-ka cul /me<sub>3</sub>\-ka en-du-ni ga-an-dug<sub>4</sub><br /> en <sup>d</sup>gilgamec<sub>2</sub> cul me<sub>3</sub>-ka en-du-ni ga-an-dug<sub>4</sub><br /> a<sub>2</sub>-/ur<sub>2</sub> sag<sub>9</sub>\-sag<sub>9</sub> cul me<sub>3</sub>-/ka\ en-du-ni ga-an-dug<sub>4</sub><br /> en TUR /kalag\-kalag-ga cul me<sub>3</sub>-ka en-/du\-ni ga-an-dug<sub>4</sub></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><em>吉尔伽美什史诗</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-445777-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup></p> </div> <hr /> <img src="http://scp-jp-storage.wikidot.com/local--files/file:6611312-6-mxij/2EC0BA4A-2BC8-4ABA-BB6A-E98B13B35906.png" alt="2EC0BA4A-2BC8-4ABA-BB6A-E98B13B35906.png" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scp-jp-storage.wikidot.com/local--files/file:6611312-7-q0ry/56833BC0-6D10-4F09-8C5F-96C95764E0A5.png" alt="56833BC0-6D10-4F09-8C5F-96C95764E0A5.png" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/local--files/dingir/03.jpg" alt="03.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/local--files/dingir/04.jpg" alt="04.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/local--files/dingir/05.jpg" alt="05.jpg" class="image" /> <blockquote> <p><strong>作图:</strong> ©︎<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hitsujikaip" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6611312&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607865611" alt="hitsujikaip" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6611312)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hitsujikaip" >hitsujikaip</a></span><br /> <strong>年份:</strong> 2020</p> </blockquote> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">脚注</a><a href="javascript:;">关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-445777-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. <strong>译注：</strong>dingir是加在吉尔伽美什史诗中给吉尔伽美什、恩奇都等人名字前的尊称，意即“神明”</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-445777-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. <strong>长歌乎，献与猛士也！<br /> 长歌乎，吉尔伽美什，颂我君子，猛士也！<br /> 长歌乎，四体美亦匀，猛士也！<br /> 长歌乎，其人强亦盛&#8230;&#8230;主也，猛士也！</strong><br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><em>汉语翻译：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607865611" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></em></p> </div> <p>引用自<a href="http://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/cgi-bin/etcsl.cgi?text=c.1.8.1.2&amp;display=Crit&amp;charenc=&amp;lineid=c1812.1.A.1">The Erectronic Text Corpus of Sumerian Literature</a></p> <p>© Copyright 2003, 2004, 2005, 2006 The ETCSL project,<br /> 牛津大学 东方研究院<br /> 于 2016-11-30 由 RC 更新</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div class="foldable-list-container"></div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607865611" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></p> 
